        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Planning a Coed Baby Shower? Why They’re the New Thing — Plus Party Themes Guests Will Love Fact Checked by Caroline Picard, Deputy Editor",
        "text_sha256": "456fddb1d80ac032614e4ae613e892dac36918d62316766f0f8988ed044d7096",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000086",
        "block_index": 86,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "11 Fall Pregnancy Announcements That Are Pure Autumnal Bliss Fact Checked by Olivia DeLong, Senior Health Editor",
        "text_sha256": "1eaad1e1404423e4e6216e036b104b99009321b1fa9a9fe67003053368b71d50",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000087",
