        "text": "Baby Shower Invitation Wording Ideas Fact Checked by Caroline Picard, Deputy Editor",
        "text_sha256": "e58d4f7d6fdf4cd7970f48ed82658c0cb4b7788a3d48551e5556bea4eb6f1f45",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
